WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.000
Kann es nach dem 7. Oktober noch Frieden geben?

00:09.100 --> 00:11.166
"Will there be peace"?

00:17.433 --> 00:19.333
If it was up to Israel,

00:21.266 --> 00:23.400
we had it a long time ago.

00:23.400 --> 00:25.133
But it is not up to us.

00:28.100 --> 00:32.266
There were a few attempts throughout history,

00:32.266 --> 00:34.066
including right now.

00:37.466 --> 00:40.066
Radical Islamists are not looking for peace,

00:40.866 --> 00:41.966
period.

00:42.900 --> 00:43.366
Always...

00:43.366 --> 00:46.100
when people ask me "what should happen with Gaza?",

00:46.100 --> 00:49.633
in my opinion, it shouldn't be us

00:49.633 --> 00:53.000
or the United States that goes to help there.

00:53.300 --> 00:55.200
It should be

00:55.466 --> 00:59.966
moderate Muslim countries that are strong enough,

00:59.966 --> 01:02.000
and that they are moderate enough,

01:02.000 --> 01:04.466
to stop the horrible indoctrination

01:04.466 --> 01:05.800
that is going on over there.

01:05.866 --> 01:09.966
To make a big change and to bring to the people

01:09.966 --> 01:13.500
the same prosperity that people enjoy

01:13.500 --> 01:16.200
in more stable countries.

01:16.300 --> 01:19.600
Countries that function, that don’t...

01:20.966 --> 01:22.200
I must tell you this,

01:22.200 --> 01:24.966
this example is brilliant:

01:26.200 --> 01:27.333
Covid...

01:28.266 --> 01:30.300
Covid happened,

01:30.466 --> 01:34.566
right about when the Abraham Accords were taking place,

01:36.166 --> 01:38.266
and as a gesture of goodwill,

01:38.366 --> 01:42.500
The UAE decided they are going to donate,

01:43.233 --> 01:47.633
I think it was 1. 5 million vaccines, to the Gaza Strip

01:47.633 --> 01:48.900
and to the West Bank.

01:50.666 --> 01:52.166
They said "No",

01:52.900 --> 01:54.966
"We’re not taking it from you".

01:55.700 --> 01:57.400
The UAE, that you can see

01:57.400 --> 02:00.633
on their people how good rulers they are,

02:00.633 --> 02:02.766
because you see the situation over there,

02:02.766 --> 02:04.100
and how free the people are,

02:04.100 --> 02:05.433
and how happy and...

02:07.066 --> 02:09.500
They were in complete shock.

02:09.833 --> 02:12.533
They're like "There's a pandemic on the loose",

02:13.000 --> 02:16.866
"and we give you 1. 5 million vaccines for your people",

02:17.000 --> 02:19.466
"and you’re not taking it because of your ego!",

02:19.800 --> 02:21.500
they were completely shocked,

02:21.500 --> 02:22.366
but it also

02:22.366 --> 02:25.166
gave them a good picture of who they're dealing with.

02:25.300 --> 02:28.066
This is a terror organization.

02:28.466 --> 02:31.100
Wake up, it’s a terror organization,

02:31.466 --> 02:37.433
and it’s about time that the entire world will stand up

02:37.433 --> 02:42.566
firmly and fiercely against that horrible

02:42.566 --> 02:46.700
terror groups that are around the world.

02:46.700 --> 02:48.300
We should not accept terror.

02:48.300 --> 02:50.400
I see people around the world supporting terror groups,

02:50.400 --> 02:52.333
I'm going to..., it really...

02:54.800 --> 02:56.366
I can’t even...

02:56.366 --> 02:59.166
I don’t have a reply to that,

02:59.166 --> 03:01.400
and that is amazing because you all know that

03:01.400 --> 03:02.766
I have replies for everything.

03:02.833 --> 03:05.300
But for that one I really can’t.

03:05.300 --> 03:07.666
I can’t even think about what to say to these people.

03:07.666 --> 03:09.666
"Have you all gone mad?"

03:11.166 --> 03:13.066
Do you see the people

03:13.066 --> 03:16.466
in Gaza what they're going through by their own regime?

03:17.166 --> 03:19.866
Do you understand how many people in the last two years

03:19.866 --> 03:21.366
were murdered by Hamas?

03:22.233 --> 03:24.000
We know some of the stories.

03:24.000 --> 03:25.500
We know people that tried to speak up,

03:25.500 --> 03:28.133
and they were butchered and tortured,

03:28.433 --> 03:31.800
and remains were put on the threshold of their family.

03:34.266 --> 03:36.033
So people will see and

03:36.033 --> 03:37.900
be afraid to do anything,

03:38.400 --> 03:41.800
will despair. So how can you,

03:41.800 --> 03:45.666
How on earth can anybody support that?

03:45.666 --> 03:47.833
How on earth?

03:47.833 --> 03:49.366
It really troubles me,

03:49.600 --> 03:51.533
because if you look back at history,

03:52.300 --> 03:54.966
look at World War 2 for example,

03:55.300 --> 03:57.266
there were about half a million

03:57.266 --> 03:58.900
British people that died,

03:58.900 --> 04:00.700
about half a million Americans,

04:01.300 --> 04:07.766
and about 20 million Russians,

04:08.033 --> 04:10.400
and people from the Soviet Union.

04:10.800 --> 04:15.533
And it took the human race decades,

04:15.566 --> 04:17.300
decades, to realize that

04:17.300 --> 04:19.533
Stalin was mass murdering his own people.

04:20.666 --> 04:22.366
Decades to realize that.

04:22.366 --> 04:24.600
Because we don’t think about it.

04:24.966 --> 04:27.300
How did Monty Python say?

04:27.300 --> 04:29.333
"No one expects the Spanish Inquisition"

04:29.366 --> 04:32.466
You’re not thinking about things like that.

04:35.033 --> 04:36.166
But, it happens.

04:36.700 --> 04:39.800
It happens. And we have a few examples from history.

04:39.866 --> 04:43.133
And people need to be a little bit more,

04:44.233 --> 04:46.166
need to have a little bit more critical thinking.

04:46.600 --> 04:49.266
A little bit more critical thinking,

04:49.266 --> 04:52.766
when they say that I'm an occupier with

04:52.766 --> 04:55.666
A 7 long hour drive land.

04:55.666 --> 04:58.166
People have to have a little bit more critical thinking.

04:58.166 --> 04:59.000
around the world.

04:59.866 --> 05:02.366
That's it. I've got nothing more to say.
